		\Ebb\left[ \mathbf{1}_{(\uptau_{R,\uppi,\delta,\kappa}=+\infty)}  \|\u(t)-\Urm(t)\|^2_{2} \right] \leq e^{R+\uppi - \frac{\delta\kappa}{(1+\delta)^2}t} \|\u_0-\Urm_0\|^2_2.
