[Lemma 21 of arXiv:2604.18871, 'Quantitative approximation of the Vlasov(--Fokker--Planck)--Navier--Stokes system by stoch'] There exists $C \equiv C(T,k,A,\lVert u \rVert_{L^\infty_{x}}, \gamma, d,p)>0$ such that for any $N\in \N^*$,
