	\bE\int_{S_n} \lt\|X^n_s\rt\|^p  \nu_n(\od s)  & = \bE\int_{S_n} \lt\|X^n_s\rt\|^p \1_{\{X^n_s \in K_n\}} \nu_n(\od s) + \bE\int_{S_n} \lt\|X^n_s\rt\|^p \1_{\{X^n_s \notin K_n\}} \nu_n(\od s) \\
	& \le \|K_n\|^p \nu_n(S_n) + 1 \le \lt\|K_n\rt\|^p C_\nu + 1 <\infty.
\end{align*}
Applying H\"older's inequality and noting that $\nu_n(S_n) <\infty$, we obtain $\bE ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:9f10dcd67cfe45420d9121471cff8b93a19597a2f7ce0234d1a78931efce29b4","revision_digest":"sha256:f11adbc01e521bb99da7e4780cfbaef25534dbddd43ce508fb1122b2de858e55","source_id":"arxiv:2608.30357","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-07","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

