[Lemm l:moments-wh-L of arXiv:2607.18194, 'Temperature chaos in directed polymers'] Let $\widehat{\mathcal{L}}^\varepsilon$ be as in Definition (def:discrete-LPP of the paper).
    For all $p\geqslant 1$ and all $\varepsilon \leqslant \delta^{100/\gamma}$, we have      
    \begin{align*}
        \sup_{z,w\in J^{\delta}}
        \mathbb{E}\left[
            \left|\widehat{\mathcal{L}}^\varepsilon(0,z;\delta^{3/2},w)
                + \frac{(z-w)^2}{\delta^{3/2}}
            \right|^p
            \right]
        \lesssim_{p}
        \delta^{p/2} \log^{4p/3}(1/\delta).
    \end{align*}

