    The set of values of $H_\omega$ is countable: each $H_\omega$ is a subgroup of the finitely generated nilpotent group $\Gamma_0$. Each level set $\{\omega : H_\omega = H\}$ is Borel, and the cocycle relation makes the partition into level sets $\alpha$-equivariant. By the cocycle reduction ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:7dd569283b55a17af01b99fc67bb4b11afaba739912223d9635af4635e9cab06","revision_digest":"sha256:f1cab5b9da499d161409e33c9c3a9531fddfacc566bd0b9062b349c61e18df94","source_id":"arxiv:2605.16921","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-07","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

