[Lemma lem:continuity_projection_Sobolev of arXiv:2412.01645, 'Regularisation by Gaussian rough path lifts of fractional Brownian motions'] For $k \in\mathbb{N}, p \geq 2$, there exists a constant $C=C(k,p)$ such that for all $F \in \mathbb{D}^{k,p}(V)$ we have 
    \begin{equs}
        \| \Pi_{\mathcal{H}_s^\perp}F \|_{\mathbb{D}^{k,p}(V\otimes \mathcal{H})} \leq C \|F \|_{\mathbb{D}^{k,p}(V\otimes \mathcal{H})}.
    \end{equs}

