[Corollary 26 ($\AW_2$ between Gaussian martingales) of arXiv:2604.22159, 'Adapted optimal transport between filtered Gaussian processes'] Let $L, M \in \mathscr{L}(N, d)$ be such that $\bG^{L}, \bG^{M} \in \cFG_{\mgle}$. Then
\begin{equation} 
\dist_\mathrm{AW}^2(L,M)=\sum_{t=1}^N (N-t+1)\dist_\BW^2(L_{t,t}L_{t,t}^\intercal,M_{t,t}M_{t,t}^\intercal).
\end{equation}

