[Lem 14 of arXiv:2609.03777, '2609.03777'] Let $k\geq3$. For $\tau\in C$ and $R>0$, we have
\begin{align}
\summ{\mu\in\latzero\\|\mu|>R}\frac{\LL(|\mu|)^m}{|\mu|^k}\ll_{C,k,m}\frac{\LL(R)^m}{R^{k-2}},\\
\summ{\mu\in\latzero\\0<|\mu|\leq R}\frac{\LL(|\mu|)^m}{|\mu|^2}\ll_{C,m}\LL(R)^{m+1}\,.
\end{align}

