[Lemma lem:ftpbds of arXiv:2606.02472, 'Correlated uniform attachment trees'] Let $T_n\sim\mathrm{UA}(n)$ and fix constants  $0<s<\beta\leq 1$. Then for all $k=0,1,\ldots, n$, we have
\ben{
\mathbb{P}(F_{T_n}(k) \geq \beta n)  \leq  (1-\beta +s)^k + e^{-n s^2/2}.
}
For any $0<\gamma<1$, $0<\beta<1$, and $k\leq \gamma n$, with $ \frac{\beta  + 2\gamma + 2/n}{1-\gamma} \leq 1$ we have 
\ben{
\mathbb{P}(F_{T_n}(k) \geq \beta n) \geq  \bbbclr{1- \frac{\beta  + 2\gamma + 2/n}{1-\gamma}}^k.
}

