[Lemma of arXiv:2606.19313, 'Stability of Khintchine-type inequalities via log-monotonicity'] Let $q\geq 2$ be an integer and $a\in \mathbb{R}^n$ satisfy $\sum_ka_k^2=1$. Then for all $n$, 
\begin{align*}
\Delta_q(a)\geq \sum_ka_k^4.
\end{align*}

