  		&=(2\pi )^{-d/2}\int_{|z|\leqslant |x|}\phi_{\rho}(x-\sqrt{t}z)\mathrm{e}^{-|z|^2/2}\mathrm{d} z+(2\pi )^{-d/2}\int_{|z|> |x|}\phi_{\rho}(x-\sqrt{t}z)\mathrm{e}^{-|z|^2/2}\mathrm{d} z\\
  		&\leqslant C\phi_{\rho}(x)\int_{|z|\leqslant |x|}\mathrm{e}^{-|z|^2/2}\mathrm{d} z+C\int_{|z|> |x|}\mathrm{e}^{-|z|^2/ 2}\mathrm{d} z\\
  		&\leqslant C\phi_{\rho}(x)+C\int_{|x|}^\infty \mathrm{e}^{-r}\mathrm{d} r\leqslant C\phi_{\rho}(x).
  	\end{align*}
  	So (equation eq:Ptphi of the paper) holds for all $t\in [0,T]$ and ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:308df2d192cfbbd1a8acd91f4f4747b888bb0722ff3a01b505c2bc045ecf1b1d","revision_digest":"sha256:ff1e0390ef56d52ec077ff01e35e62ebac7ea0aa3f21a8ad980d7d9747aeb711","source_id":"arxiv:2604.20094","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

